    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d29-a4">

                <pb facs="0352" n="342" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv05/pg342"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Translation]<anchor n="3"
                            xml:id="d29-f1"/></seg></opener>
                <p>With regard to the Grand Duchy of Luxemburg, Germany renounces the benefit of all
                    the provisions inserted in her favour in the Treaties of February 8,
                        1842,<anchor n="4" xml:id="d29-f2"/> April 2, 1847,<anchor n="5"
                        xml:id="d29-f3"/> October 20–25, 1865,<anchor n="6" xml:id="d29-f4"/> August
                    18, 1866,<anchor n="7" xml:id="d29-f5"/> February 21 and May 11, 1867,<anchor
                        n="8" xml:id="d29-f6"/> May 10, 1871,<anchor n="9" xml:id="d29-f7"/> June
                    11, 1872,<anchor n="10" xml:id="d29-f8"/> and November 11, 1902,<anchor n="11"
                        xml:id="d29-f9"/> and in all Conventions consequent upon such Treaties.</p>
                <p>Germany recognizes that the Grand Duchy of Luxemburg ceased to form part of the
                    German Zollverein as from January 1, 1919, renounces <pb facs="0353" n="343"
                        xml:id="pg343"/> all rights to the exploitation of the railways, adheres to
                    the termination of the régime of neutrality of the Grand Duchy, and accepts in
                    advance all international arrangements which may be concluded by the Allied and
                    Associated Powers relating to the Grand Duchy.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
